            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:comment>Portion of tissue which consists of neurons, neuroglia and vasculature. Examples: Neural tissue of brain, neural tissue of peripheral ganglion, neural tissue of nerve[FMA]</rdfs:comment>
