        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing"/>
        <rdfs:comment>&quot;An occurrentis  an  entity  that  unfolds  itself  in  time  or  it  is  the  instantaneous boundary  of  such  an  entity  (for  example  a  beginning  or  an  ending)  or  it  is  a  temporal  or spatiotemporal region which such an entity occupies_temporal_region or occupies_spatiotemporal_region.&quot; (Basic Formal Ontology)</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:seeAlso>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000003</rdfs:seeAlso>
    </owl:Class>
    


